  "description": "Documentize is a powerful class library that can be used with C#, F#, VB.NET for a wide range of PDF processing tasks: merge, split, rotate, resize, optimize, extract text, extract images, extract form data, extract meta data, encrypt, decrypt, sign, add tables, add TOC. Documentize offers a wide range of features to enhance productivity. You can convert PDF to the following formats: PDF/A, HTML, DOC, DOCX, XLS, XLSX, CSV, ODS, PNG, JPEG, JPG, TIFF. Contains AI integration.",
